.TH COMMAND8-MONITOR 1 "2026-07-06" "command8 0.1.0" "command8 manual"
.SH NAME
command8\-monitor \- loopback demo for the Digidesign Command|8 control surface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B command8\-monitor
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B command8\-monitor
opens the Command|8 over ALSA, performs the USB\-MIDI wake/keepalive
handshake, and runs a pure\-loopback demo Backend: faders drive meters,
encoders move the pan dot, and select/mute/solo toggle their LEDs. It needs no
DAW and is useful for verifying that the device, the kernel MIDI\-input quirk,
and the protocol layer all work.
.PP
It waits for the device to appear and re\-opens it on replug.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR command8\-reaper (1),
.BR command8\-mackie (1)
